What is printed?

```java
public class Point {
    private int x;
    private int y;

    public Point() {
        x = 0;
        y = 0;
    }

    public Point(int x, int y) {
        this.x = x;
        this.y = y;
    }

    public String toString() {
        return "(" + x + ", " + y + ")";
    }
}

// elsewhere:
Point p = new Point();
System.out.println(p);
```

What does `p.getX()` return after this code runs?

```java
public class Point {
    private int x;

    public Point(int x) {
        this.x = x;
    }

    public int getX() {
        return x;
    }

    public void setX(int newX) {
        x = newX;
    }
}

// elsewhere:
Point p = new Point(5);
p.setX(12);
int result = p.getX();
```

